===Etymology 4===
From {{inh|en|ang|lēoht}}, {{m|ang|līht}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*lį̄ht}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*linhtaz}} or {{m|gem-pro|*līhtaz}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*h₁lengʷʰ-||light}}.

Cognate with {{cog|nl|licht}}, {{cog|de|leicht}}, {{cog|sv|lätt}}, {{cog|no|lett}}, {{cog|sq|lehtë}}, {{cog|la|levis}}, {{cog|ru|лёгкий}}, {{cog|lt|lengvas}}, {{cog|sa|लघु}}, {{cog|fa|لاغر}} (lāghar).

